    -- addon:data.affix_text.ambush_on_a_target_that_dies_within_6_se:text
    ["Ambush on a target that dies within 6 sec returns you to stealth and refunds @value@100@value@ @range@[40-100]@range@ energy. Once every 30 sec (Does not stack)"] = "Si el objetivo de tu Emboscada muere en menos de 6 s, vuelves al sigilo y recuperas @value@100@value@ @range@[40-100]@range@ p. de energía. Una vez cada 30 s (No se acumula)",
