    -- addon:data.affix_text.disengage_leaves_a_gust_behind_you_absor:text
    ["Disengage leaves a gust behind you: absorbs @value@150%@value@ @range@[30%-150%]@range@ of your Attack Power for 6 sec, and enemies in the gust are knocked down for 1 sec (not bosses) (Does not stack)"] = "Separación deja una ráfaga de viento tras de ti: absorbe daño equivalente al @value@150%@value@ @range@[30%-150%]@range@ de tu poder de ataque durante 6 s, y los enemigos en la ráfaga quedan derribados durante 1 s (no afecta a jefes) (No se acumula)",
    -- addon:data.affix_family.dissolution:text
    ["Dissolution"] = "Disolución",
    -- addon:data.affix_text.divine_storm_consecrates_the_ground_unde:text
    ["Divine Storm consecrates the ground under every enemy it hits for 4 sec: @value@50%@value@ @range@[10%-50%]@range@ of your Attack Power as Holy damage every second (Does not stack)"] = "Tormenta divina consagra el suelo bajo cada enemigo al que alcanza durante 4 s: daño de Sagrado equivalente al @value@50%@value@ @range@[10%-50%]@range@ de tu poder de ataque cada segundo (No se acumula)",
    -- addon:data.affix_text.divine_storm_heals_you_as_well_as_the_al:text
    ["Divine Storm heals you, as well as the allies it heals, for an extra @value@30%@value@ @range@[10%-30%]@range@ of its damage (Does not stack)"] = "Tormenta divina te sana a ti, además de a los aliados a los que sana, un @value@30%@value@ @range@[10%-30%]@range@ adicional de su daño (No se acumula)",
